      "html": "<p>Gabriele is co-founder of buildo, where he’s a software engineer, working with Scala, JavaScript and Swift. He founded the Scala User Group in Milan and he’s an organizer of Scala Italy, the Italian conference on Scala. In the – rare – free time, you’ll find him on a plane or at the basketball court.</p>"
